CowSwapModule_Validate
├── when params are malformed
│   ├── it should return false with invalid params encoding reason
│   └── it should match execute failure reason
├── when amount is zero
│   ├── it should return false with zero sell amount reason
│   └── it should match execute failure reason
├── when target token is zero address
│   └── it should return false with zero target token reason
├── when target token equals sell token
│   └── it should return false with same sell and buy token reason
├── when slippage bps is invalid
│   └── it should return false with invalid slippage bps reason
├── when sell token price feed is missing
│   └── it should return false with missing sell token price feed reason
├── when buy token price feed is missing
│   └── it should return false with missing buy token price feed reason
├── when max staleness is zero
│   └── it should return false with zero max staleness reason
├── when validity duration is zero
│   └── it should return false with zero validity duration reason
├── when validity duration overflows uint32
│   ├── it should return false with validity duration overflow reason
│   └── it should match execute failure reason
├── when oracle price is unavailable
│   └── it should return false with oracle price unavailable reason
├── when oracle floor rounds to zero
│   └── it should return false with amount too small for safe swap reason
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return false with insufficient balance reason
└── when all parameters are valid
    ├── it should return true
    └── it should return empty reason string
